{"ocrText": "307\nON  ZIMMERWALD108\nIt is now quite clear that we made a mistake by not\nwithdrawing  from  it.\nEverybody is being bamboozled by hopes from Stockholm.\nMeanwhile the Stockholm Conference is being \u201cpostponed\u201d\nfrom  month  to  month.\nAnd Zimmerwald is \u201cwaiting\u201d for Stockholm! The Ka-\nutsky men plus the Italians, i.e., the Zimmerwald majority,\nare  \u201cwaiting\u201d  for  Stockholm.\nAnd we are joining in this comedy, bearing responsibility\nfor  it  before  the  workers.\nIt  is  a  disgrace.\nWe  must  withdraw  from  Zimmerwald  immediately.\nBy staying there for information only, we lose nothing,\nbut we are not going to be held responsible for the comedy\nof  \u201cwaiting\u201d  for  Stockholm.\nIn leaving rotten Zimmerwald we must decide immediate-\nly, at the plenary meeting on September 3, 1917, to call\na conference of the Left-wingers, and entrust this to the\nStockholm  representatives.\nWhat has happened is that, after we made a blunder by\nstaying in Zimmerwald, our Party, the world\u2019s only inter-\nnationalist party with seventeen newspapers, etc., is play-\ning at compromise with the German and Italian Martovs\nand Tseretelis, just as Martov is compromising with Tse-\nreteli, just as Tsereteli is compromising with the Socialist-\nRevolutionaries and as the Socialist-Revolutionaries are\ncompromising  with  the  bourgeoisie.\nAnd this is called \u201cstanding for\u201d the Third International!!!\nWritten  not  later  than\nSeptember  3  (16),  1917\nFirst  published  in\nPublished  according  to\nLenin  Miscellany  VII,  1928\nthe  manuscript", "textLayer": [{"text": "307", "x": 85.42, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.45, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "ON", "x": 34.28, "y": 20.52, "w": 4.16, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "ZIMMERWALD", "x": 39.91, "y": 20.52, "w": 20.87, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "108", "x": 60.98, "y": 20.29, "w": 2.51, "h": 1.16, "fontSize": 6.9}, {"text": "It is now quite clear that we made a mistake by not", "x": 11.67, "y": 25.0, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "withdrawing  from  it.", "x": 8.89, "y": 26.94, "w": 27.98, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Everybody is being bamboozled by hopes from Stockholm.", "x": 11.67, "y": 28.88, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Meanwhile the Stockholm Conference is being \u201cpostponed\u201d", "x": 8.89, "y": 30.82, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "from  month  to  month.", "x": 8.89, "y": 32.76, "w": 29.72, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "And Zimmerwald is \u201c", "x": 11.67, "y": 34.7, "w": 30.52, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "waiting", "x": 42.37, "y": 34.72, "w": 10.27, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201d for Stockholm! The Ka-", "x": 52.77, "y": 34.7, "w": 36.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "utsky men plus the Italians, i.e., the Zimmerwald majority,", "x": 8.89, "y": 36.62, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "are  \u201cwaiting\u201d  for  Stockholm.", "x": 8.89, "y": 38.56, "w": 39.47, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "And we are joining in this comedy, bearing", "x": 11.67, "y": 40.5, "w": 59.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "responsibility", "x": 71.26, "y": 40.52, "w": 17.64, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "for  it  before  the  workers.", "x": 8.89, "y": 42.44, "w": 33.13, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "It  is  a  disgrace.", "x": 11.67, "y": 44.38, "w": 22.43, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "We  must  withdraw  from  Zimmerwald", "x": 11.67, "y": 46.32, "w": 53.42, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "immediately", "x": 65.22, "y": 46.33, "w": 14.71, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ".", "x": 79.88, "y": 46.32, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "By staying there for information only, we lose nothing,", "x": 11.67, "y": 48.24, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "but we are not going to be held", "x": 8.89, "y": 50.17, "w": 43.54, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "responsible", "x": 52.89, "y": 50.19, "w": 15.42, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "for the comedy", "x": 68.8, "y": 50.17, "w": 20.09, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of  \u201cwaiting\u201d  for  Stockholm.", "x": 8.89, "y": 52.11, "w": 35.9, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "In leaving rotten Zimmerwald we must decide immediate-", "x": 11.67, "y": 54.05, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "ly, at the plenary meeting on September 3, 1917,", "x": 8.89, "y": 55.99, "w": 70.32, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "to call", "x": 79.97, "y": 56.01, "w": 8.93, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "a conference of the Left-wingers", "x": 8.89, "y": 57.95, "w": 45.15, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ", and entrust this to the", "x": 54.16, "y": 57.93, "w": 34.72, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Stockholm  representatives.", "x": 8.89, "y": 59.85, "w": 36.33, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "What has happened is that, after we made a blunder by", "x": 11.67, "y": 61.79, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "staying in Zimmerwald, our Party, the world\u2019s only inter-", "x": 8.89, "y": 63.73, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "nationalist party with seventeen newspapers, etc., is", "x": 8.89, "y": 65.67, "w": 72.93, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "play-", "x": 82.31, "y": 65.69, "w": 6.57, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "ing at compromise", "x": 8.89, "y": 67.63, "w": 26.78, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "with the German and Italian Martovs", "x": 36.36, "y": 67.61, "w": 52.53, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "and Tseretelis, just as Martov is compromising with Tse-", "x": 8.89, "y": 69.55, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "reteli, just as Tsereteli is compromising with the Socialist-", "x": 8.89, "y": 71.47, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Revolutionaries and as the Socialist-Revolutionaries are", "x": 8.89, "y": 73.41, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "compromising  with  the  bourgeoisie.", "x": 8.89, "y": 75.35, "w": 48.02, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "And this is called \u201cstanding for\u201d the Third International!!!", "x": 11.67, "y": 77.29, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 11.64, "y": 81.16, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "not", "x": 20.18, "y": 81.16, "w": 3.08, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "later", "x": 24.21, "y": 81.16, "w": 4.47, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "than", "x": 29.63, "y": 81.16, "w": 4.29, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "September", "x": 11.59, "y": 82.51, "w": 10.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "3", "x": 22.81, "y": 82.57, "w": 0.94, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 24.8, "y": 82.51, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "16", "x": 25.6, "y": 82.57, "w": 1.91, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 27.73, "y": 82.51, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 30.01, "y": 82.57, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "First", "x": 13.96, "y": 84.37, "w": 4.65, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "published", "x": 19.56, "y": 84.37, "w": 9.26, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "in", "x": 29.75, "y": 84.37, "w": 1.84, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 65.99, "y": 84.37, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 76.36, "y": 84.37, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 86.64, "y": 84.37, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Lenin", "x": 9.13, "y": 85.72, "w": 5.7, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Miscellany", "x": 15.76, "y": 85.72, "w": 10.7, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "VII", "x": 27.41, "y": 85.72, "w": 3.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": ",", "x": 30.67, "y": 85.7, "w": 0.53, "